### 📄 第一步：修改后端 `TeacherController.java`

新增一个 `/add-student-to-course` 接口。

```java
    // ✅ 新增：将已有学生加入指定课程
    @PostMapping("/add-student-to-course")
    @Transactional
    public Map<String, Object> addStudentToCourse(@RequestBody Map<String, String> params) {
        Map<String, Object> result = new HashMap<>();
        try {
            String studentUsername = params.get("studentUsername");
            Long courseId = Long.valueOf(params.get("courseId"));
            String teacherUsername = SecurityContextHolder.getContext().getAuthentication().getName();

            // 1. 查学生存不存在
            User student = userMapper.findByUsername(studentUsername);
            if (student == null || !"STUDENT".equals(student.getRole())) {
                throw new RuntimeException("未找到该学号对应的学生");
            }

            // 2. 查课程存不存在，以及是不是这个老师的课
            Course course = courseService.getCourseById(courseId);
            User teacher = userMapper.findByUsername(teacherUsername);
            if (course == null || !course.getTeacherId().equals(teacher.getId())) {
                throw new RuntimeException("课程不存在或无权操作");
            }

            // 3. 检查是不是已经选过了
            if (courseSelectionService.getStudentsByCourseId(courseId).stream()
                    .anyMatch(s -> s.getStudentId().equals(student.getId()))) {
                throw new RuntimeException("该学生已经在您的这门课程中");
            }

            // 4. 检查课是否满了
            if (course.getSelectedCount() >= course.getCapacity()) {
                throw new RuntimeException("该课程人数已满，无法添加");
            }

            // 5. 帮他选课
            courseSelectionService.forceSelectCourse(student.getId(), courseId);

            result.put("success", true);
            result.put("message", "添加成功！已将【" + student.getRealName() + "】加入课程");
        } catch (Exception e) {
            result.put("success", false);
            result.put("message", e.getMessage());
        }
        return result;
    }
```

