### 📌 第一步：修改后端（补全院系数据）

由于你现在的学生名单里只有班级没有院系，我们需要修改一下查询 SQL。

**1. `CourseSelection.java` 实体类**
加上院系字段：
```java
    private String department; // ✅ 新增：所属院系
```

**2. `CourseSelectionMapper.xml`**
把 `selectStudentsByCourseId` 改成联表查询，把院系名一起查出来：

```xml
    <select id="selectStudentsByCourseId" resultType="com.students.jwsystem_public.entity.CourseSelection">
        select
            cs.id,
            cs.student_id    as studentId,
            cs.course_id     as courseId,
            cs.select_time   as selectTime,
            u.username       as studentUsername,
            u.real_name      as studentName,
            sc.class_name    as className,
            d.dept_name      as department,  <!-- ✅ 新增：查出院系 -->
            s.score          as score
        from course_selection cs
        inner join `user` u on cs.student_id = u.id
        left join score s on s.student_id = cs.student_id and s.course_id = cs.course_id
        left join sys_class sc on u.class_id = sc.id
        left join major m on sc.major_id = m.id       <!-- ✅ 新增：关联专业 -->
        left join department d on m.dept_id = d.id    <!-- ✅ 新增：关联院系 -->
        where cs.course_id = #{courseId}
        order by d.dept_name, sc.class_name, u.username
    </select>
```

