### 💻 第三步：改造 `selectCourse` 业务代码（见证奇迹）

打开 `CourseSelectionServiceImpl.java`。咱们要在选课逻辑外面包一层分布式锁。

把原来的 `selectCourse` 方法**完整替换**成下面这段代码：

```java
    @Autowired
    private RedissonClient redissonClient; // ✅ 注入 Redisson

    @Override
    @Transactional
    public String selectCourse(Long courseId, String username) {
        User user = userMapper.findByUsername(username);
        Long studentId = user.getId();

        // 1. 创建一把锁，Key 命名规则：lock:course:课程ID
        // 这样所有抢这门课的学生，抢的都是同一把锁
        String lockKey = "lock:course:" + courseId;
        RLock lock = redissonClient.getLock(lockKey);

        try {
            // 2. 尝试加锁：最多等待 3 秒，上锁后 10 秒自动释放
            boolean isLock = lock.tryLock(3, 10, TimeUnit.SECONDS);

            if (!isLock) {
                return "当前选课人数过多，请稍后重试！";
            }

            // 3. 成功拿到锁，开始执行真正的业务逻辑
            if (courseSelectionMapper.countByStudentAndCourse(studentId, courseId) > 0) return "您已选过该课程";

            Course course = courseMapper.getCourseById(courseId);
            if (course == null) return "课程不存在";
            if (course.getSelectedCount() >= course.getCapacity()) return "课程已满";

            CourseSelection cs = new CourseSelection();
            cs.setStudentId(studentId);
            cs.setCourseId(courseId);
            courseSelectionMapper.insertSelection(cs);
            courseSelectionMapper.incrementSelectedCount(courseId);

            // 选课成功后删缓存
            redisTemplate.delete("course:my:" + studentId);
            redisTemplate.delete("schedule:my:" + studentId);

            return "选课成功";

        } catch (InterruptedException e) {
            Thread.currentThread().interrupt();
            return "系统繁忙，请稍后再试";
        } finally {
            // 4. ✅ 极其关键：无论如何，在方法结束前，必须判断当前线程是否持有锁，并释放
            if (lock.isHeldByCurrentThread()) {
                lock.unlock();
            }
        }
    }
```

*(记得导入对应的包：`org.redisson.api.RLock` 和 `org.redisson.api.RedissonClient`)*

